         entry spacing (0.008) apart. Wi-Fi is placed by the widest time, 00:00, which is
         3.37 em of the status size; other times leave a little more room.
         The Index title starts its capitals where the first row of the list does, at the
         heights of 16:9 (see ar-16-9.xml) -->
